8. RECEIPT SYSTEM
================================================================================

Professional receipt generation and printing system.

─── 8.1 RECEIPT CONTENT ───

  Receipt layout (42-character width, Consolas monospace font):
  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │          [Company Logo Image]            │
  │         Business Name Line 1             │
  │         Business Name Line 2             │
  │        ─────────────────────             │
  │        Custom Receipt Header             │
  │        ─────────────────────             │
  │ Order: #ORD-XXXXX                        │
  │ Date:  DD/MM/YYYY HH:MM                 │
  │ Cashier: [User Name]                     │
  │ Payment: [Cash/Card/Transfer/Mobile]     │
  │ ──────────────────────────────────────── │
  │ Item Name           Qty    Price   Total │
  │ ──────────────────────────────────────── │
  │ [Item 1]             x2   ₦500  ₦1,000  │
  │ [Item 2]             x1   ₦300    ₦300  │
  │ ──────────────────────────────────────── │
  │ TOTAL                          ₦1,300.00 │
  │ ──────────────────────────────────────── │
  │        Custom Receipt Footer             │
  │          Thank you message               │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────┘

─── 8.2 RECEIPT FEATURES ───

  • FlowDocument-based rendering
  • Company logo image included (from BrandingSettings.LogoImagePath)
  • Configurable header and footer text
  • Dynamic currency formatting
  • Payment method displayed
  • Cashier name from logged-in user
  • Auto-generated on order completion
  • Available from order history for completed orders

─── 8.3 RECEIPT PREVIEW ───

  • Dedicated ReceiptPreviewWindow
  • FlowDocumentScrollViewer for on-screen viewing
  • Print button to send to system printer
  • Logo image cloned for print document
  • Scrollable preview before printing

─── 8.4 PRINTING ───

  • System print dialog integration
  • FlowDocument paginated for printer
  • Logo image support in printed output
  • Standard POS receipt formatting

