11. USER INTERFACE & DESIGN
================================================================================

─── 11.1 WINDOW LAYOUT ───

  Login Window:
    • Two-panel layout (left info + right login form)
    • Left panel: Logo, business name, tagline, description, copyright,
      trademark text
    • Right panel: Login form, optional demo accounts, trademark text
    • Close confirmation dialog

  Main Window:
    • FluentWindow with Mica backdrop effect
    • Two-column layout: Sidebar (250px) + Content area
    • Minimum size: 1400 × 780 pixels
    • Centered on screen at startup

  Sidebar:
    • User info card at top (avatar, name, role)
    • Navigation buttons with emoji icons:
        – 📊 Dashboard
        – 🍽 Orders
        – 📦 Inventory (admin/developer only)
        – 📈 Reports (admin/developer only)
        – ⚙ Settings (admin/developer only)
    • Active state indicator on current page
    • Bottom section: System status, Logout button (red), Trademark text

  Content Area:
    • Scrollable content region
    • Views loaded dynamically based on nav selection
    • Trademark footer at bottom

─── 11.2 UI COMPONENTS ───

  Cards:
    • Drop shadow (2px offset, 12px blur, 6% opacity)
    • Rounded corners (16px radius)
    • White background with padding
    • Hover state effects

  Buttons:
    • Primary: Gradient background
    • Secondary: Outlined style
    • Danger: Red-themed for destructive actions
    • Hover: Opacity change
    • Active/Pressed: Scale transform
    • Disabled: 50% opacity
    • Rounded corners (10-12px)

  Input Fields:
    • White background
    • Light border (#e2e8f0)
    • Focus state: Purple border
    • Adequate padding for touch targets

  Status Indicators:
    • Color-coded badges
    • Emoji icons for visual clarity
    • Background fills matching status type

  Gradients:
    • Linear gradients (0° to 45° angles)
    • Multi-stop color transitions
    • Applied to cards, buttons, and backgrounds

─── 11.3 DIALOG & FEEDBACK ───

  • Modal overlays with semi-transparent background
  • Centered on screen
  • Escape key to close dialogs
  • Success messages in green
  • Error messages in red
  • Confirmation dialogs for all destructive actions
  • Loading indicators for async operations
  • Tab order on forms for keyboard navigation

─── 11.4 TRADEMARK SYSTEM ───

  Configurable trademark text displayed in:
    • Main window bottom footer
    • Sidebar bottom (below Logout)
    • Login window left panel (below copyright)
    • Login window right panel (below form)
  Default: "Powered by Restaurant Manager"
  Configurable via Developer tab in Admin Settings.

